  {How to Use This Manual
  {======================
       To clear this screen and continue, press {Esc}. A menu appears.
       Press the Up or Down arrow keys to select a topic. Press {Enter};
       either another menu or the text of your selection appears. To
       return to a previous screen, press {Esc}.

       When you're viewing the text of your selection, use the arrow, Page
       Up and Page Down keys to move within the text.  Press the {F1} key
       to print a copy of the text to LPT1.  Make sure your printer is on
       and ready to print {before} you press {F1}.

                     {To continue, press the Esc key.


